================================================================================================
VERDICTS
================================================================================================
  V1 [the verdict distribution at the real N and systematics]:
     at the DR4-documented N (2,000-5,000 usable pairs at 3-30 kAU) and sigma_mu 30-40 uas,
     P(CONFIRMED-STRONG) = 0.000 at EVERY documented cell.  The 9/9 outcome is structurally
     unreachable: R-RIDGE30.7's frozen 20-sigma gate needs N_usable ~ 5,760 (the ridge lands
     at 12 sigma at N=2000 and 18 sigma at
     N=5000 -- still >10 sigma, decisive vs triples, but below the frozen gate).  The
        N=2000, 40 uas (conservative): P(W)=0.466 P(SP)=0.443 P(D)=0.091  n_pass=6.34
        N=5000, 40 uas:                P(W)=0.457 P(SP)=0.471 P(D)=0.072  n_pass=6.36
        N=5000, 30 uas (G088 mid):     P(W)=0.474 P(SP)=0.450 P(D)=0.076  n_pass=6.39
        N=5000, 10 uas (optimistic):   P(W)=0.449 P(SP)=0.476 P(D)=0.075  n_pass=6.33
     sigma_mu has ~NO effect on the verdict (the P-s ridge is noise-free in the G088 mock;
     the vertical channel carries its own declared precision).  N sets the R-RIDGE30.7 gate.
  V2 [P(CONFIRMED-STRONG | conservative)]: N=2000, 40 uas -> 0.000;
     at N=5000, 40 uas -> 0.000.  P(STRONG|optimistic 10 uas) = 0.000.
     P(STRONG) turns on only past the gate: N=8000 -> 0.218 (10 uas) / 0.228 (40 uas).
  V3 [the honest statement -- the December number to watch]:
     THE THEORY'S OWN DR4 FORECAST (the mocks ARE the registered prediction) lands at
     P(CONFIRMED-STRONG) = 0.000 and a MODAL verdict of CONFIRMED-WEAK ~ SPLIT at the
     DR4-documented N: n_pass ~ 5-7 (mean 6.39 at N=5000).  The December
     outcome is capped at 8/9 (WEAK) unless the usable sample exceeds ~5,800 pairs; the
     tail to watch is P(WEAK) vs P(SPLIT) vs P(DISFAVORED), not P(STRONG).  The soft tests
     are the funnel (F1a 0.64, F1b 0.55) and the
     double-map (D2 0.70, D3 0.72) at the declared
     DR4 precision -- their pass bars sit ~1 sigma from the forecast central values, so the
     theory's OWN forecast is a coin-flip per vertical test at the frozen precision.  This
     is the pre-registered honesty floor, not a re-tuning: every bar is frozen (G165/G112).
